          "body": "The lrexlib compile issue is:\nhttps://github.com/rrthomas/lrexlib/issues/44\n\nI think that some of the code has not been using the `LUA_API` define correctly (which hasn't mattered before because `LUA_BUILD_AS_DLL` wasn't defined, but then the vcpkg replaces an `defined(LUA_BUILD_AS_DLL)` with `1` in `luaconf.h`",
